<title>DUBAI: Arafat holds talks with Saudi Arabia's King Fahd.</title>
<headline>Arafat holds talks with Saudi Arabia's King Fahd.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palestinian President Yasser Arafat arrived in Saudi Arabia on Tuesday and held talks with King Fahd on the PLO-Israeli peace process, Saudi state television reported.</p>
<p>Arafat reiterated on Monday that he was determined to see agreed-upon self-rule deals with Israel implemented and warned Palestinians would not accept something imposed on them.</p>
</text>
